 "arms": {
  "full": {
   "text": "The insulation work will also include sealing any gaps and cracks in the cabin's structure to prevent air leakage and further enhance thermal efficiency. Each layer of insulation will be carefully measured and applied to ensure maximum performance and longevity. \n\nA key part of the project is the installation of a [plant variety] along the [route number], which will help insulate the exterior and provide a natural barrier against the cold. The [net size] of insulation will be applied in a way that ensures even coverage, and the [brush width] of the brush will help achieve a smooth and consistent finish. \n\nA small but important detail is the placement of a [plant variety] in a [route number] to add a touch of green to the landscape and help with insulation. The project also includes a [hinge] in the door frame to ensure it opens and closes smoothly, and a [lantern] will be placed outside to illuminate the path and add a cozy touch to the cabin's exterior. \n\nP.P.S. Do not forget the volunteers.",
